# ── Captured traffic — large binaries, vendored out of band ──
# PCAPs are hashed and recorded in the scenario manifest, which is
# committed. The capture files themselves are distributed with the
# offline asset bundle, not through git. See git.md section 1.
*.pcap
*.pcapng
*.cap
*.erf
*.snoop
scenarios/pcaps/
scenarios/flow_records/**/*.bin
scenarios/flow_records/**/*.ipfix
scenarios/flow_records/**/*.nfcapd
!scenarios/**/*.manifest.json
!scenarios/**/expected_alerts/**

# ── Sensor output ────────────────────────────────────────────
eve.json
eve.json.*
fast.log
stats.log
suricata.log
sensor/logs/
*.evebox

# ── Trained model artifacts and large offline intel ──────────
